{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/76939-so-i-had-a-dream","id":76939,"title":"So I had a Dream..","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-02-22T02:32:01-08:00","id":76939,"title":"So I had a Dream..","content":"Last night, I had a weird dream about the God Machine. It was kinda complicated and I can't remember things well enough, but here is what I do remember-<br /> <br /> a) There was an Infrastructure going on. It was even in the form of a research question. It was that the God Machine used the energy gathered by roads and ways (like big blood vessels) in order to develop civilization<br /> <br /> b) there were weird angels which looked like balls of light which hunted down those who investigated<br /> <br /> c) The God Machine was hit by something near the end of the dream- something which was so powerful to damage it, and maybe even kill it<br /> <br /> d) The <i>dream itself</i> was a part of the Infrastructure, which was meant (in the dream) that I'll post it up in the forums when I'll wake up (Inception? Spending too much time on those forums? Being manipulated by the God Machine? 0_0)<br /> <br /> in short- any ideas how to make something cool out of that?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Shachar%20Gold\" target=\"_blank\">Check my STV content</a>, <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/28219-my-weekly-wod-project-program\" target=\"_blank\">Or My Homebrew</a><br /> <br /> &quot;And all our knowledge is, Ourselves to know&quot;- An Essay on Man<br /> <br /> I now blog in <a href=\"https://chroniclesoflostlight.wordpress.com/\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/503-lostlight","name":"LostLight","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar503_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4531"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T02:54:11-08:00","id":76948,"title":"","content":"You user account has been hacked by God-Mahcine, like opening story in <b>GMC</b>. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1437-wyrdhamster","name":"wyrdhamster","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1437_5.jpg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11313"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T06:31:30-08:00","id":77029,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>LostLight</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/76939-so-i-had-a-dream#post76939\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Last night, I had a weird dream about the God Machine. It was kinda complicated and I can't remember things well enough, but here is what I do remember-<br /> <br /> a) There was an Infrastructure going on. It was even in the form of a research question. It was that the God Machine used the energy gathered by roads and ways (like big blood vessels) in order to develop civilization<br /> <br /> b) there were weird angels which looked like balls of light which hunted down those who investigated<br /> <br /> c) The God Machine was hit by something near the end of the dream- something which was so powerful to damage it, and maybe even kill it<br /> <br /> d) The <i>dream itself</i> was a part of the Infrastructure, which was meant (in the dream) that I'll post it up in the forums when I'll wake up (Inception? Spending too much time on those forums? Being manipulated by the God Machine? 0_0)<br /> <br /> in short- any ideas how to make something cool out of that?</div> </div> </div> </div>Well my friend, I see two possible outcomes.<br /> <br /> 1. You've become Stigmatic and you are being used to further a plot of the Machine.<br /> 2. You've become Stigmatic and the Machine is arranging for hunter-angels to take you out.<br /> <br /> So in short... FLEE!! FLEE FOR YOUR LIFE!!! D:","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1686-korogra","name":"Korogra","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1686_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Dec 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1310"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T22:01:55-08:00","id":77473,"title":"","content":"This reminds me of a dream I had a long time ago. I wrote it down, going to copy and paste it:<br /> <br /> Ok, I had this dream last night, but ran out of time before I could post it. In this dream I was living somewhere in a small town in or near the desert. Somehow, I discovered that there was a secret signal being transmitted through the tv cable or somewhere on the internet. I am not sure which, but I was able to decode it with the help from my friends and jury rigging a xbox 360 to the computer/tv. The picture showed a person on a security camera doing what appeared to be random tests. Going from one machine or gadget to the next solving problems. Me and my companions figured out were the signal originated and drove down the desert highway till we came to what looked like an abandoned military base.<br /> <br /> We entered the main building and found the man in the picture working on some machines. He seemed surprised to see us and we asked him what he was doing here. He told us that he came to the military base about 20 or 30 years ago with some other volunteers to do some experiments. The people told them that they were to stay here and do some experiments on the machines lying around. They would each be called one at a time to do one final test and then be set free. The man said that each person was called one at a time until they reached him. Then nobody called him and he has waited, doing experiments ever since. After he told us this, we somehow(can't remember how), figured out that the final experiment was to see how long the man would stay before he would give up and leave. I can't remember if we told him or not, but I remember that when me and my friends tried to leave, the military security system activated and the doors/windows closed down around us locking us in. The man said that we were detected as new test subjects and that the defense system would not let us go until the test were over. I can't remember much after that except I do know we escaped somehow at the end.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2356-badmojo","name":"Badmojo","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"32"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-02-22T22:12:47-08:00","id":77478,"title":"","content":"Sounds like a Messenger came to you last night, friend.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}